<h2 id="advent-of-the-war-sun"><a href="https://twilight-imperium.fandom.com/wiki/Galactic_Events#Introduced_in_Thunder's_Edge:~:text=Advent%20of%20the%20War%20Sun">Advent of the War Sun</a></h2>
